> Using A_21_22

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestFiscalYearValidJan:
    output result content A_21_22.IsFiscalYear

scope TestFiscalYearValidJan:
    definition result equals
        output of A_21_22.IsFiscalYear with {
            -- period: Period {
                -- begin: |2020-02-01|
                -- end: |2021-01-31|
            }
        }
    assertion result.result

